      <link>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/pr-69/news/2024-grant-program-recap/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 13 Feb 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/pr-69/news/2024-grant-program-recap/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Since its inception in late 2021, the FreeCAD Project Association (FPA) has been collecting the community&amp;rsquo;s donations with the intention of spending them on improving FreeCAD and its ecosystem. In 2024, the FPA launched its first annual grant program. Here is a recap of how this went.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
