      <description>&lt;p&gt;The FPA General Assembly approved another grant application.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Ajinkya Dahale will continue refactoring Sketcher. The main deliverables are the same as the last time: more methods simplification, testing, and documentation. This will not direct affect features or usability, but it will help other developers contribute to the program.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
