    <item>
      <title>The FreeCAD day 2024</title>
      <link>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/pr-69/news/the-freecad-day-2024/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 13 Feb 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/pr-69/news/the-freecad-day-2024/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;This year again, the &lt;a href=&#34;https://fpa.freecad.org&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;external-link&#34;title=&#34;Open link&#34;&#xA;    target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    rel=&#34;external noreferrer noopener&#34;&gt;FPA&lt;span class=&#34;icon-external&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M11 7H6A2 2 0 004 9v9a2 2 0 002 2h9a2 2 0 002-2v-5&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;10&#34; y1=&#34;14&#34; x2=&#34;20&#34; y2=&#34;4&#34;/&gt;&lt;polyline points=&#34;15 4 20 4 20 9&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; organized a FreeCAD day and a hackathon (and &lt;a href=&#34;https://blog.freecad.org/2023/10/31/fosdem-freecad-day-and-hackathon-2024/&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;external-link&#34;title=&#34;Open link&#34;&#xA;    target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    rel=&#34;external noreferrer noopener&#34;&gt;much more&lt;span class=&#34;icon-external&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M11 7H6A2 2 0 004 9v9a2 2 0 002 2h9a2 2 0 002-2v-5&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;10&#34; y1=&#34;14&#34; x2=&#34;20&#34; y2=&#34;4&#34;/&gt;&lt;polyline points=&#34;15 4 20 4 20 9&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;!) together with &lt;a href=&#34;https://fosdem.org&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;external-link&#34;title=&#34;Open link&#34;&#xA;    target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    rel=&#34;external noreferrer noopener&#34;&gt;FOSDEM&lt;span class=&#34;icon-external&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M11 7H6A2 2 0 004 9v9a2 2 0 002 2h9a2 2 0 002-2v-5&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;10&#34; y1=&#34;14&#34; x2=&#34;20&#34; y2=&#34;4&#34;/&gt;&lt;polyline points=&#34;15 4 20 4 20 9&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, in Brussels. We had an incredible, epic week of events (which you&amp;rsquo;ll know all about later on this blog). I&amp;rsquo;ll describe here briefly what happened during the hackathon and the FreeCAD day.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>FPA Grant for Toponaming work</title>
      <link>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/pr-69/news/fpa-grant-for-toponaming-work/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 25 Jan 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/pr-69/news/fpa-grant-for-toponaming-work/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;The FPA has just given two grants for work on the Toponaming merge to community members @bgbsww and @CalligaroV-the two are working together for the next two months to integrate @realthunder&amp;rsquo;s Topological Naming Problem mitigation code into the main development branch of FreeCAD. Kudos to them on their selection, and we are all looking forward to their work!&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Bringing stability to the FreeCAD Release process</title>
      <link>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/pr-69/news/bringing-stability-to-the-freecad-release-process/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 30 Oct 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/pr-69/news/bringing-stability-to-the-freecad-release-process/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Since its inception, FreeCAD&amp;rsquo;s build and release process has been an entirely volunteer effort. As the project has grown, however, this has resulted in ever more work for the volunteers. Maintaining the various builds and releases is a mostly invisible, thankless process; but also one that is mission-critical. The FreeCAD Project Association is pleased to announce that we have contracted with long-time FreeCAD developer Adrián Insaurralde (@adrianinsaval) to maintain FreeCAD&amp;rsquo;s build and release infrastructure. Adrián will be the main point of contact for all official builds and releases for the next year.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Revamping the FreeCAD Project Association’s Grant program</title>
      <link>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/pr-69/news/revamping-the-freecad-project-associations-grant-program/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 28 Sep 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/pr-69/news/revamping-the-freecad-project-associations-grant-program/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;TL;DR: the FreeCAD Project Association studied best practices of other organizations that have grant programs and is now working towards improving its own program.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>FPA Needs a Logo</title>
      <link>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/pr-69/news/fpa-needs-a-logo/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 27 Mar 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/pr-69/news/fpa-needs-a-logo/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://fpa.freecad.org/&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;external-link&#34;title=&#34;Open link&#34;&#xA;    target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    rel=&#34;external noreferrer noopener&#34;&gt;The FreeCAD Project Association&lt;span class=&#34;icon-external&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M11 7H6A2 2 0 004 9v9a2 2 0 002 2h9a2 2 0 002-2v-5&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;10&#34; y1=&#34;14&#34; x2=&#34;20&#34; y2=&#34;4&#34;/&gt;&lt;polyline points=&#34;15 4 20 4 20 9&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; (FPA)&amp;rsquo;s Mission is to support and protect the FreeCAD project. As an organization independent of the community FreeCAD project, the FPA would like to have a logo that is visually distinct. To that end, last month &lt;a href=&#34;https://forum.freecad.org/viewtopic.php?t=76211&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;external-link&#34;title=&#34;Open link&#34;&#xA;    target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    rel=&#34;external noreferrer noopener&#34;&gt;we held open submissions for a new logo&lt;span class=&#34;icon-external&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M11 7H6A2 2 0 004 9v9a2 2 0 002 2h9a2 2 0 002-2v-5&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;10&#34; y1=&#34;14&#34; x2=&#34;20&#34; y2=&#34;4&#34;/&gt;&lt;polyline points=&#34;15 4 20 4 20 9&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. Over the last week, FPA members have been voting for their favorites, and we have it narrowed to five final candidates.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>FPA 2022 report</title>
      <link>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/pr-69/news/fpa-2022-report/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 21 Mar 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/pr-69/news/fpa-2022-report/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;After an amazing first year of operations, the &lt;a href=&#34;https://fpa.freecad.org&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;external-link&#34;title=&#34;Open link&#34;&#xA;    target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    rel=&#34;external noreferrer noopener&#34;&gt;FreeCAD project association (FPA)&lt;span class=&#34;icon-external&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M11 7H6A2 2 0 004 9v9a2 2 0 002 2h9a2 2 0 002-2v-5&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;10&#34; y1=&#34;14&#34; x2=&#34;20&#34; y2=&#34;4&#34;/&gt;&lt;polyline points=&#34;15 4 20 4 20 9&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, the non-profit body that supports the FreeCAD project, has just published its very first yearly report, which also includes plans for 2023. Thanks to everybody who put their trust in the FPA so early on!&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
